{
  "body": "独立 G3 已通过，仅准许本候选固定提交；尚未集成 main 或关闭 Issue。\n\n- 实现：[a2995dfb](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/a2995dfb187a70064d2e54ce336a72c24974721a)，S3永久祖先4f78bd48保留。\n- [独立G3原件](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/a2995dfb187a70064d2e54ce336a72c24974721a/docs/design/rust-r4abc/g3-independent08.json.bin)，SHA256 `4abaab087cd553341427e7f608bf9aaeda86d061c6bc4727e7437871dbb1ad0b`。\n- [实际验收边界](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/a2995dfb187a70064d2e54ce336a72c24974721a/docs/design/rust-r4abc/validation-checkpoint57.md)：Rust310/54历史ignored、Native863、Angular411；59必要写故障/6锁屏障/外项目锁负例及Linux续跑链、Windows完整原UI，旧失败/partial与Native参考不升格。\n- 1004自有行清理，113表seed/catalog/ACL恢复及两次noop，运行对象0、自有运行态停止；卷/private保留。\n- 仅#103/#104/#105/#102可在各自独立G4后关闭，#101/#57持续Open。\n"
}
